---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | networkandcode" description="Cloud, DevOps, Networking, and Systems engineering background.">
  <div class="container about-page">
    <div class="glass-card about-card">
      <h1 class="about-title">About networkandcode</h1>
      
      <p class="about-tagline">
        <code>blog &gt; practice &gt; share | [ network coding cloud… ]</code>
      </p>

      <div class="about-content">
        <p>
          Welcome! This site serves as an engineering portfolio and a structured knowledge base of notes/posts related to technical topics such as Cloud Native Infrastructure, Kubernetes Orchestration, Software-Defined Networking, and Systems Automation.
        </p>

        <h2>Core Domains</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cloud Architecture:</strong> AWS & GCP infrastructure design, Terraform, and Serverless computing.</li>
          <li><strong>Containers & Orchestration:</strong> Production Kubernetes (EKS, GKE, Anthos, Kubeadm), Helm chart packaging, and Cloud Native runtime security.</li>
          <li><strong>Networking & Edge:</strong> BGP/OSPF routing, Cumulus Linux, Linux networking tools (TCPDump, Wireshark), and IoT MQTT protocols.</li>
          <li><strong>Full-Stack & Observability:</strong> Next.js, Node.js, Python, HarperDB, Graph DBs (Neo4j), and OpenTelemetry tracing (OTEL).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Connect & Explore</h2>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="https://dev.to/networkandcode" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-badge">
